  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lubuveg Horticulture Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Horticulture Production; including snow peas, tomatoes, onions, kale and related greens. , Beneficiaries: 510 small scale vegetable farmers, including 204 women. , USADF funds will be used for management training and capacity building; construction of collection centers; developing a sorting / grading facility; training in grading of products; technical support and agronomy training in how to improve agriculture production and reduce post harvest losses; purchase of motorcycles for extension activities and to collect farmers for meetings; an inputs revolving fund; and product diversification and marketing support.</narrative>
  </description>
